    <h1>Thank You, Jane</h1>
    <p class="tribute-intro">Jane Goodall inspired us in so many ways. She played a major role in letting Vulpera come to life. She inspired us in varying ways, and we are deeply grateful for her contributions to wildlife conservation and education. In celebration of her legacy, we honor her memory and continue her work.
    </p>
    
    <div class="message-wall">
        <div class="message-card">
            <h3>Soren Saal,  <i>Founder</i></h3>
            <p>I've followed Jane Goodall's work for many years, and her dedication to wildlife conservation has
                been a huge inspiration for me. Her groundbreaking research on chimpanzees and her tireless advocacy
                for animal welfare have shown me the importance of protecting our planet's biodiversity. Jane's work has
                motivated me to start the Vulpera Ecological Collective, and I am committed to continuing her legacy of
                conservation and education.<br>
                <strong>Jane's impact on my life and the world is immeasureable, and I am forever grateful for her contributions.</strong><br>
                Thank you, Jane, for being a beacon of hope and a source of inspiration for all of us who care about the natural world.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="message-card">
            <h3>Beau Drysdale,  <i>UK Volunteer</i></h3>
            <p>Jane Goodall is a figure that remains indelible in the memory of conservationists and environmentalists, such
                as myself, even beyond the grave. She did so much for this planet's chimps and other animals, and her work
                is both honoured and continued through Vulpera.
            </p>
        </div>
